    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108009" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερωτ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>reply by a question,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				483a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>ask artfully,</i> or <i>slip in a question,</i> Arg.<i><span class="en">
				D.
				1.5
			</span></i>, and so perh. in <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
			</span></i> l.c.: perh. simply <i>ask,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαρτυροῦντας τὰ ὑπερωτώμενα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1237.73
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv B. C.)</span>.</div>
